abseil's BUILD.gn files are generated by convert_bazel_to_gn.py, which the ebuild runs. 158's
converter adds `check_includes_strict = CHECK_INCLUDES_STRICT_PUBLIC_INCLUDES_PRIVATE` to 16
targets, an enum the gn 158 pins (938087829f) doesn't have yet ("Undefined identifier"), and
which upstream's checked-in BUILD.gn files (made before those entries were added) don't have
either. Drop those entries, so the converter writes upstream's checked-in files again.

